@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .

# Regression (CLEANUP: max-errors precedence): an ordinary violating shape
# (AAAShape, sorts/scans first) plus a recursive shape over cyclic data
# (ZZZShape, scans second). With max-errors=1, AAAShape's single violation
# alone reaches the cap -- ZZZShape's cycle must still be detected and take
# precedence over the truncated report, not be silently skipped because the
# per-node-shape loop stopped evaluating once the cap was hit.
ex:AAAShape a sh:NodeShape ; sh:targetClass ex:V ; sh:property [ sh:path ex:name ; sh:minCount 1 ] .
ex:ZZZShape a sh:NodeShape ; sh:targetClass ex:CY ; sh:property [ sh:path ex:p ; sh:node ex:ZZZShape ] .
